# What this module needs on the machine, name | kind | locator | policy | consumer | reason.
# The format and the kinds are documented in the repository root AGENTS.md. This file names
# tools and never how to install one, since that mapping is DEPENDENCIES.map one layer up.
# Written by hand, because this module has no sub units to fold declarations from.
jq  | path | jq  | required | statusline-command.sh | parsing the session json the status line is built from
git | path | git | optional | statusline-command.sh | the branch shown in the status line
pbcopy | system | /usr/bin/pbcopy | optional | skills/handoff/SKILL.md | putting the handoff prompt on the clipboard, without it the handoff file is still written
claude | path | claude | required | the whole module | the program this module configures, without it the status line, commands and skills have nothing to run in
herdr | path | herdr | optional | statusline-command.sh | reporting the session name to the herdr pane the session runs in, so its agents sidebar shows it, nothing is reported outside herdr
